    "created_at": "2026-04-03T12:19:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-03T12:19:01Z",
    "body": "I think it probably makes more sense to put this on a deprecation path after #12150 is stable than to do so before.  So whatever we do here indeed may well be temporary.\n\n(I also think sanitizers generally produce valid markup rather than misnested markup, so this probably isn't an issue for them.)",
